1
00:01:15,900 --> 00:01:22,850
But forty years ago this ground,
Was filled with laughter all around.

2
00:01:23,238 --> 00:01:30,534
We sat inside the sunny air,
Our parents smiling free from care.

3
00:01:30,882 --> 00:01:38,027
All the ones we loved are gone,
But you, my Luna, are alive!

4
00:01:38,080 --> 00:01:45,550
The wind has swept the table clean,
From the cold fields where we have been.

5
00:01:52,934 --> 00:01:59,953
My parents and yours too,
And all the friends that once we knew.

6
00:02:00,311 --> 00:02:07,398
They all are sleeping in the clay,
Their voices gently swept away.

7
00:02:07,967 --> 00:02:14,910
All the ones we loved are gone,
But you, my Luna, are alive!

8
00:02:15,141 --> 00:02:22,645
The wind has swept the table clean,
From the cold fields where we have been.

9
00:02:30,036 --> 00:02:36,758
The Lion whispers in the cold:
"Don't let your warm heart grow old."

10
00:02:37,335 --> 00:02:44,703
"The table of the past is bare,"
"But your sweet love is always there."

11
00:02:44,948 --> 00:02:52,066
All the ones we loved are gone,
But you, my Luna, are alive!

12
00:02:52,290 --> 00:02:59,674
The wind has swept the table clean,
From the cold fields where we have been.

13
00:03:14,139 --> 00:03:21,363
Just the wind is left to blow,
Where we once loved so long ago.

14
00:03:21,453 --> 00:03:28,007
You are still here, and so am I,
Under this winter sky…

15
00:03:28,919 --> 00:03:36,149
All the ones we loved are gone,
But you, my Luna, are alive!

16
00:03:36,196 --> 00:03:43,731
The wind has swept the table clean,
From the cold fields where we have been.

